WEBVTT

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.695
Last time
on Star Trek: Voyager...

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.035
You are resilient prey.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.199
L'm no one's prey!

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.370
She'll survive.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.470
What about her neural interface?

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.740
Stable.

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.409
Shall l return her
to the Klingon simulation?

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.474
No.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.713
Bring her to Holodeck 1.

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:23.086
L've found another program
l want to try.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:28.493
Here in your arms this way...

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:29.495
l'm Katrine.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.588
Le Coeur de Lion
is my establishment.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.121
The commandant would have us

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.293
continue this simulation
until we rot.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:37.132
It's pointless.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.398
We should begin the hunt.

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.838
We've been able to expand
both holodeck grids

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.671
by 5,000 square meters.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:43.971
More.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.535
The colonel is
in a strange mood today.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.481
L have found a way
to disable the interface

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:57.387
by remodulating
one of your Borg implants

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.449
to emit a jamming signal.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:01.323
You circumvented our control!

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.453
How?

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.463
You're sending a message
to the Nazis.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:05.429
No.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.592
Step away or l'll kill you.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.060
Need a hand, buddy?

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.130
Captain Miller,
Fifth Armored Infantry.

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.903
Welcome to Sainte Claire.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:17.068
This building
is being targeted.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.099
Let's get out of here.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.443
You wanted a war?

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.643
Looks like you've got one.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:26.811
And now the conclusion.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.970
Looks like the Hirogen
have been busy.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.636
This entire section
has been equipped

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:52.645
with holo-emitters.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:54.146
Let's get to Astrometrics.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.858
There are 85 Hirogen on board

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.293
concentrated
on Decks 2 through 9.

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:10.557
What about the Bridge?

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.294
Four Hirogen and Ensign Kim.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.699
At least he's alive.

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:16.724
The neural interfaces...

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.430
you said they're controlled
through Sick Bay.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.304
Yes. There's only one
Hirogen in Sick Bay

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:23.673
with the Doctor,
but the corridors

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:24.836
outside are heavily guarded.

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:26.675
That's our first objective...
disable the interfaces...

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.078
but we'll need help.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:30.878
We did have allies in the
World War II simulation...

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:31.906
the French Resistance.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.818
It's time we mount
a resistance of our own.

00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:31.965
The battle is concentrated
here in Holodeck 1,

00:04:32.003 --> 00:04:34.403
but the fighting has spilled
out onto Decks 5 and 6.

00:04:34.438 --> 00:04:36.372
And it looks like a group
of holographic Americans

00:04:36.407 --> 00:04:37.374
is invading Deck 7.

00:04:37.408 --> 00:04:39.842
Show me the breach
in the hologrid.

00:04:41.212 --> 00:04:42.941
L've lost the visual link.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.277
It was the last active circuit

00:04:44.315 --> 00:04:45.976
connecting the Bridge
to the holodecks.

00:04:46.017 --> 00:04:48.485
There's only one way
to stop this.

00:04:48.586 --> 00:04:51.384
L need to go to Engineering
and initiate a power surge

00:04:51.422 --> 00:04:52.821
across the holo-emitter network.

00:04:52.857 --> 00:04:54.085
It'll blow out
the entire system.

00:04:54.125 --> 00:04:56.286
No. That would destroy
both the holodecks.

00:04:56.327 --> 00:04:59.319
Look, simulation or not,
if this battle keeps going

00:04:59.363 --> 00:05:00.728
we could all be killed.

00:05:00.765 --> 00:05:04.030
L want that technology
preserved.

00:05:04.068 --> 00:05:05.626
Commander.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.728
Status.

00:05:06.771 --> 00:05:08.398
L was able to reach Deck 5,

00:05:08.439 --> 00:05:11.272
but holographic forces
are massing near the breach.

00:05:11.309 --> 00:05:13.140
If l'm to get into the holodeck,
l'll need help.

00:05:13.177 --> 00:05:15.611
Take the hunters
from the Klingon simulation.

00:05:15.646 --> 00:05:18.740
When l find Captain Janeway,
should l kill her?

00:05:18.783 --> 00:05:20.080
No.

00:05:20.117 --> 00:05:21.812
Bring her to me.

00:05:21.852 --> 00:05:24.047
This is no longer a game.

00:05:24.088 --> 00:05:25.453
This hunt is real.

00:05:25.489 --> 00:05:26.888
We should kill the prey.

00:05:26.924 --> 00:05:31.554
The Voyager crew must
remain alive to make repairs

00:05:31.595 --> 00:05:34.029
or we could lose everything...

00:05:34.065 --> 00:05:36.363
this vessel, its technology.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.868
You said that you understood
the importance

00:05:38.903 --> 00:05:40.803
of what we're doing here.

00:05:42.306 --> 00:05:44.240
L'll get the hunters.

00:05:51.615 --> 00:05:53.583
We think it's a secret compound
the Nazis built

00:05:53.617 --> 00:05:55.209
after they took over the city.

00:05:55.252 --> 00:05:56.446
What l don't understand

00:05:56.487 --> 00:05:58.682
is how they managed
to camouflage it so well.

00:05:58.723 --> 00:05:59.747
Indeed.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.382
We've been scrutinizing
German troop movements

00:06:01.425 --> 00:06:02.949
since the occupation.

00:06:02.994 --> 00:06:04.427
We knew nothing
of this installation.

00:06:04.528 --> 00:06:05.552
Don't sweat it.

00:06:05.596 --> 00:06:07.826
Our recon planes missed it, too.

00:06:07.865 --> 00:06:10.390
Any idea what they're
hiding in there, Captain?

00:06:10.434 --> 00:06:13.801
We saw all sorts of scientific
equipment... strange metals,

00:06:13.838 --> 00:06:15.635
instruments we can't identify.

00:06:15.673 --> 00:06:18.039
L've relayed the findings
to Military Intelligence.

00:06:18.075 --> 00:06:19.042
They believe this

00:06:19.076 --> 00:06:21.374
could be an advanced
munitions laboratory

00:06:21.412 --> 00:06:23.346
designed to build
some kind of superweapon.

00:06:23.381 --> 00:06:24.780
We've got to put it
out of business.

00:06:24.815 --> 00:06:26.180
L've already sent
three squads in,

00:06:26.217 --> 00:06:28.447
but the Nazis are putting up
one hell of a fight.

00:06:28.519 --> 00:06:29.986
L've requested
additional troops.

00:06:30.021 --> 00:06:32.012
Lieutenant,
this restaurant will serve

00:06:32.056 --> 00:06:33.455
as our command post.

00:06:33.524 --> 00:06:34.684
Set up the transmitter

00:06:34.725 --> 00:06:35.953
and post guards
around the perimeter.

00:06:35.993 --> 00:06:37.551
Yes, sir.

00:06:37.595 --> 00:06:40.621
You've done a bang-up job,
but we'll take it from here.

00:06:40.664 --> 00:06:41.995
Tell your people to lie low

00:06:42.033 --> 00:06:44.467
and that the Americans
said "thanks."

00:06:45.503 --> 00:06:46.470
This is our city.

00:06:46.504 --> 00:06:49.337
We have no intention
of lying low.

00:06:49.373 --> 00:06:50.362
Listen, honey, the time

00:06:50.408 --> 00:06:52.035
for sneaking messages
back and forth is over.

00:06:52.076 --> 00:06:54.909
This is war,
and you aren't soldiers.

00:06:54.945 --> 00:06:56.640
He's right.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.080
We have weapons hidden
throughout the city.

00:06:59.116 --> 00:07:00.640
Brigette will tell
you where they are.

00:07:00.684 --> 00:07:01.651
Sounds good.

00:07:01.685 --> 00:07:03.880
Lieutenant, take care of it.

00:07:13.564 --> 00:07:16.055
L can see you haven't changed.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.534
Bring me one
of those street maps.

00:07:25.743 --> 00:07:28.268
Most of the guns, we stole
from the German army.

00:07:28.312 --> 00:07:31.076
The explosives, we bought
from the black market.

00:07:31.115 --> 00:07:32.742
We could use both.

00:07:32.783 --> 00:07:35.547
Our biggest stockpile
is buried here...

00:07:35.586 --> 00:07:37.019
two meters beneath
the last row of seats

00:07:37.054 --> 00:07:38.453
of the Cinema Mystère.

00:07:38.556 --> 00:07:40.888
You remember it, don't you?

00:07:40.925 --> 00:07:43.587
Hmm.

00:07:43.627 --> 00:07:45.219
L'm No Angel with Mae West.

00:07:47.898 --> 00:07:49.229
There's heavy fighting
in that area.

00:07:49.266 --> 00:07:51.166
What's the best way in?

00:07:51.202 --> 00:07:54.831
We dug a tunnel that leads
directly to the stockpile.

00:07:54.872 --> 00:07:56.499
Here. L'll show you.

00:07:58.609 --> 00:07:59.974
Incidentally...

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:02.740
we saw Death Takes a Holiday.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:05.806
It was the Mae West movie.
L'm sure of it.

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.717
She was singing...

00:08:08.752 --> 00:08:11.983
"Sister Honky Tonk,"
and l put my arm around you.

00:08:12.022 --> 00:08:15.583
And during
the courtroom scene...

00:08:15.626 --> 00:08:17.457
l kissed you.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.921
You know, l think you're right.

00:08:21.966 --> 00:08:25.424
L guess the experience wasn't
exactly burned into your memory.

00:08:25.503 --> 00:08:27.232
Not the movie.

00:08:27.271 --> 00:08:29.171
But l do remember the kiss.

00:08:34.445 --> 00:08:36.379
So...

00:08:36.413 --> 00:08:38.074
did you get my last letter?

00:08:38.115 --> 00:08:40.845
You mean the one asking
me to leave France?

00:08:40.885 --> 00:08:42.648
Germany was about to invade.

00:08:42.686 --> 00:08:46.053
L thought you'd be safer
back in the States... with me.

00:08:48.425 --> 00:08:50.655
But... l guess
you found someone else

00:08:50.694 --> 00:08:51.956
to take care of you.

00:08:51.996 --> 00:08:54.430
There's never been
anybody else.

00:08:54.465 --> 00:08:55.454
Then who?

00:08:55.566 --> 00:08:58.831
He's second in command
of the Sainte Claire occupation.

00:08:58.869 --> 00:09:02.100
The first time he saw me,
he said l was pretty.

00:09:02.139 --> 00:09:04.004
L took advantage
of his interest.

00:09:04.041 --> 00:09:08.171
He doesn't know
l'm in the Resistance.

00:09:08.212 --> 00:09:09.702
The child is his.

00:09:12.783 --> 00:09:14.774
L'm sorry.

00:09:16.053 --> 00:09:18.021
So am I.

00:09:27.598 --> 00:09:29.293
Hold your fire.

00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:30.994
Katrine...

00:09:31.035 --> 00:09:32.332
you survived.

00:09:32.369 --> 00:09:34.303
Are you surprised?

00:09:34.338 --> 00:09:35.305
Very.

00:09:35.339 --> 00:09:36.670
Nazi headquarters was destroyed.

00:09:36.707 --> 00:09:38.641
We assumed you were killed
in the explosion.

00:09:38.676 --> 00:09:39.643
What is that?

00:09:39.677 --> 00:09:41.611
Some kind of an escape tunnel?

00:09:41.645 --> 00:09:44.614
That's precisely what it is.

00:09:44.648 --> 00:09:46.275
You're the leader
of the local Resistance.

00:09:46.317 --> 00:09:47.284
That's right.

00:09:47.318 --> 00:09:50.344
Captain Miller,
Fifth Armored Infantry.

00:09:50.387 --> 00:09:51.945
This is Lieutenant Davis.

00:09:51.989 --> 00:09:54.219
L take it you've seen the
German bunker we uncovered.

00:09:54.258 --> 00:09:56.351
L just came from there.

00:09:56.393 --> 00:09:57.451
We suspect it's a munitions lab.

00:09:57.561 --> 00:09:58.550
Can you confirm that?

00:09:59.797 --> 00:10:01.856
Yes. A munitions lab.

00:10:01.899 --> 00:10:03.423
Then this is it.

00:10:03.467 --> 00:10:04.456
We're calling in an air strike.

00:10:04.568 --> 00:10:05.466
Contact the RAF.

00:10:05.569 --> 00:10:06.558
Hold on, Captain.

00:10:06.604 --> 00:10:08.071
There's an easier way
to do this

00:10:08.105 --> 00:10:09.470
with a minimum of casualties.

00:10:10.574 --> 00:10:12.974
Let's hear it.

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:15.911
L've located the generator
that powers the entire complex.

00:10:15.946 --> 00:10:17.914
It's heavily guarded,
but with your help,

00:10:17.948 --> 00:10:20.178
l can get close enough
to set off some explosives.

00:10:20.217 --> 00:10:22.481
My orders are to blow
the entire compound

00:10:22.553 --> 00:10:24.180
before the Germans
send in reinforcements.

00:10:24.221 --> 00:10:27.486
L saw technology in there
you can't begin to imagine...

00:10:27.524 --> 00:10:30.357
warheads powerful enough
to destroy this entire valley

00:10:30.394 --> 00:10:32.123
if they're
accidentally detonated.

00:10:32.162 --> 00:10:33.595
Call for an air strike,

00:10:33.631 --> 00:10:35.462
may be the last call you make.

00:10:37.801 --> 00:10:39.393
How can you get close enough?

00:10:39.436 --> 00:10:41.131
This tunnel.

00:10:41.171 --> 00:10:42.729
L've been watching this compound

00:10:42.773 --> 00:10:45.071
for several months,
and l've got a man inside.

00:10:45.109 --> 00:10:46.906
The place is crawling
with Krauts.

00:10:46.944 --> 00:10:48.502
That's why l need your help.

00:10:48.612 --> 00:10:51.638
If your men can clear
these two corridors,

00:10:51.682 --> 00:10:53.980
it'll give us access
to this entryway.

00:10:54.018 --> 00:10:56.418
Get me there,
and l can take care of the rest.

00:10:56.453 --> 00:10:58.819
"C" Company...
what's their status?

00:10:58.856 --> 00:11:02.155
They're holding position
about 200 yards from here.

00:11:05.296 --> 00:11:07.389
Get them on the horn.

00:11:07.431 --> 00:11:08.728
You'll lead us
into the compound,

00:11:08.766 --> 00:11:09.790
but l'm coming with you.

00:11:09.833 --> 00:11:11.266
L work better alone.

00:11:11.302 --> 00:11:12.826
This isn't a request.
It's an order.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:13.837
Order? Do l look

00:11:13.871 --> 00:11:15.304
like l'm wearing
one of your uniforms?

00:11:15.339 --> 00:11:16.306
L go alone.

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.432
L thought you needed our help.

00:11:17.474 --> 00:11:19.567
L'll be right behind you.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.804
Lieutenant Blake.

00:11:20.844 --> 00:11:22.334
There's been
a change of plans...

00:11:26.083 --> 00:11:28.916
Even if l manage to disrupt
the neural interfaces,

00:11:28.952 --> 00:11:30.419
we've still got a war to fight.

00:11:30.454 --> 00:11:32.888
We're going to need something
a lot more effective

00:11:32.923 --> 00:11:34.117
than these old firearms.

00:11:34.158 --> 00:11:36.388
L believe l can enhance
these weapons

00:11:36.427 --> 00:11:37.792
using Borg technology,
but l'll have

00:11:37.828 --> 00:11:39.591
to access Cargo Bay 2.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.690
If something goes wrong
and l don't succeed,

00:11:42.733 --> 00:11:44.200
you'll be the only one left

00:11:44.234 --> 00:11:45.997
who knows what's
really going on.

00:11:46.036 --> 00:11:47.526
Understood.

00:11:50.074 --> 00:11:51.507
Have our suspicions
been confirmed?

00:11:51.542 --> 00:11:52.509
Suspicions?

00:11:52.543 --> 00:11:56.445
Ls she a collaborator?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.004
L think we can trust her.

00:11:58.048 --> 00:11:59.743
Are you certain?

00:11:59.783 --> 00:12:01.148
Three hours ago,
you were prepared

00:12:01.185 --> 00:12:02.345
to put a bullet in her head.

00:12:02.386 --> 00:12:04.149
She's on our side.

00:12:04.188 --> 00:12:06.019
In your absence,

00:12:06.056 --> 00:12:08.650
l may be forced to make
that determination for myself.

00:12:08.692 --> 00:12:10.159
L've already made it.

00:12:10.194 --> 00:12:11.218
You're not to harm her.

00:12:11.261 --> 00:12:12.819
Is that understood?

00:12:18.502 --> 00:12:21.027
German forces are advancing
on our position.

00:12:22.539 --> 00:12:24.632
Let's give them a warm welcome.

00:12:27.611 --> 00:12:29.374
Mademoiselle, after you.

00:12:33.751 --> 00:12:36.049
Punctured lung,
arterial rupture,

00:12:36.087 --> 00:12:37.816
fracture of the 13th vertebrae.

00:12:37.855 --> 00:12:38.981
He needs surgery.

00:12:41.025 --> 00:12:43.960
First- and second-degree burns
to the face and neck.

00:12:43.995 --> 00:12:45.019
Treat him.

00:12:45.062 --> 00:12:46.029
His injuries are minor.

00:12:46.063 --> 00:12:47.030
He can wait.

00:12:47.064 --> 00:12:48.497
L said treat him!

00:12:48.532 --> 00:12:50.500
This man has
massive internal injuries.

00:12:50.568 --> 00:12:52.001
If l don't operate now,
he'll die.

00:12:52.036 --> 00:12:55.062
Treat the burns, or l'll
deactivate your program.

00:12:55.106 --> 00:12:57.597
What kind of physician are you?

00:12:57.641 --> 00:12:58.903
The first rule of triage

00:12:58.943 --> 00:13:00.911
states that critical injuries
take priority.

00:13:00.945 --> 00:13:03.140
Your rules, not mine.

00:13:07.952 --> 00:13:11.444
From now on, leave the wounded
prey where they fall.

00:13:11.522 --> 00:13:13.353
Tend only to our own.

00:13:16.427 --> 00:13:22.525
L'm as dry
as the crater at Tarpahk...

00:13:24.568 --> 00:13:27.765
...in the middle
of the dry season...

00:13:27.805 --> 00:13:30.035
when it's dry!

00:13:34.645 --> 00:13:36.010
L'm not done!

00:13:36.047 --> 00:13:38.106
Share with your brothers.

00:13:38.149 --> 00:13:39.912
It's the eve of battle.

00:13:44.455 --> 00:13:46.923
L may be drunk,

00:13:46.957 --> 00:13:50.017
but l can still send your soul
to the next world

00:13:50.061 --> 00:13:52.757
and leave your body here
to rot!

00:13:52.797 --> 00:13:56.096
Though from the stench of it,
l'd say it's begun to already.

00:14:15.519 --> 00:14:17.111
Tom.

00:14:17.154 --> 00:14:18.985
Wrong guy.

00:14:19.023 --> 00:14:19.990
You speak English?

00:14:20.024 --> 00:14:21.924
Yeah.

00:14:21.959 --> 00:14:23.392
L speak English.

00:14:23.427 --> 00:14:24.553
American?

00:14:26.764 --> 00:14:28.095
L didn't see him coming.

00:14:28.132 --> 00:14:29.099
You saved my life.

00:14:29.133 --> 00:14:30.691
Why are you out of uniform?

00:14:30.734 --> 00:14:31.826
What company are you with?

00:14:31.869 --> 00:14:33.461
Um...

00:14:33.537 --> 00:14:35.471
well, l'm a... l'm a civilian.

00:14:35.539 --> 00:14:37.837
In the middle
of a battle zone in France?

00:14:37.875 --> 00:14:38.842
The hell you are.

00:14:40.211 --> 00:14:41.337
Go on.

00:14:41.378 --> 00:14:43.278
L'm right behind you.

00:14:43.314 --> 00:14:46.340
Look, l don't have time
for 20 questions.

00:14:46.383 --> 00:14:48.180
You say you're an American?

00:14:48.219 --> 00:14:51.746
All right then, if Betty Grable
came around that corner

00:14:51.789 --> 00:14:53.313
what part of her
would you be staring at?

00:14:58.028 --> 00:15:00.724
Sorry. Time's up.

00:15:00.764 --> 00:15:01.662
Her legs!

00:15:01.699 --> 00:15:03.758
L-l'd be staring at her legs.

00:15:08.806 --> 00:15:10.273
Bull's-eye.

00:15:12.276 --> 00:15:14.267
Lucky for you.

00:15:18.249 --> 00:15:20.911
You're a gung ho kind of gal,
aren't ya?

00:15:20.951 --> 00:15:22.179
Does that bother you?

00:15:22.219 --> 00:15:25.245
Nope. Just not used to it,
that's all.

00:15:25.289 --> 00:15:27.883
The girls back home
are a little different.

00:15:27.925 --> 00:15:31.122
L guess when it comes
to my people's safety,

00:15:31.162 --> 00:15:35.656
this girl tends to get
a little... gung ho.

00:15:35.699 --> 00:15:37.132
Nothing to apologize for.

00:15:37.168 --> 00:15:38.897
L'm the same way with my men.

00:15:38.936 --> 00:15:42.201
There's not a day goes by
when l don't think to myself,

00:15:42.239 --> 00:15:44.605
"l'm going to get
'em back safely

00:15:44.642 --> 00:15:46.371
even if l die trying."

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.139
L know the feeling.

00:15:50.214 --> 00:15:53.240
We're about to enter some caves
that run under the town.

00:15:53.284 --> 00:15:54.251
Caves?

00:15:54.285 --> 00:15:55.718
We're going to meet
our contact there.

00:15:55.753 --> 00:15:56.811
L should warn you.

00:15:56.854 --> 00:15:59.254
There are eccentric people
who live in the caves,

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.917
but don't be alarmed.

00:16:08.866 --> 00:16:12.734
...ro-cha loH qech

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:16.900
ro-cha loH qech

00:16:16.941 --> 00:16:23.938
qor'taH-taH-taH-taH-
taH-taH-taH Dech roH

00:16:23.981 --> 00:16:27.678
taH-taH-taH-taH-taH-taH

00:16:27.718 --> 00:16:30.016
Dech roH!

00:16:30.054 --> 00:16:31.919
Good evening, gentlemen.

00:16:31.956 --> 00:16:34.117
Who are you?

00:16:34.158 --> 00:16:37.355
How did you get past
our battle lines?

00:16:37.394 --> 00:16:38.554
We're friends.

00:16:38.596 --> 00:16:39.961
Allies.

00:16:39.997 --> 00:16:41.464
Sent by what House?

00:16:41.565 --> 00:16:42.657
The House of...

00:16:44.635 --> 00:16:47.433
...of ToH-Maag.

00:16:47.471 --> 00:16:50.463
ToH-Maag.

00:16:50.507 --> 00:16:52.475
L never heard of it.

00:16:52.576 --> 00:16:53.600
L'm not surprised.

00:16:53.644 --> 00:16:55.111
It's a long way from here.

00:16:55.145 --> 00:16:58.046
This battle doesn't concern you.

00:16:58.082 --> 00:16:59.071
Maybe not...

00:17:01.986 --> 00:17:03.351
but we'd be honored

00:17:03.387 --> 00:17:06.151
to fight alongside
such great warriors.

00:17:07.992 --> 00:17:10.426
If you prefer, we'll take
our weapons elsewhere.

00:17:10.527 --> 00:17:12.154
Wait!

00:17:12.196 --> 00:17:14.790
L'll consider your request...

00:17:14.832 --> 00:17:18.825
but first, prove your fortitude.

00:17:18.869 --> 00:17:19.961
Drink!

00:17:20.004 --> 00:17:22.438
San-roH

00:17:22.539 --> 00:17:24.404
t'patoH-cha!

00:17:24.441 --> 00:17:27.569
L guess my French
is a little rusty.

00:17:27.611 --> 00:17:29.306
Don't drink it.

00:17:29.346 --> 00:17:31.007
It's twice as strong as whiskey.

00:17:31.048 --> 00:17:32.879
L'll be right back.

00:17:37.721 --> 00:17:39.621
Eh?

00:17:55.472 --> 00:17:58.202
Captain. Is... is it you?

00:17:58.242 --> 00:18:01.109
Yes. We've got to disable
the rest of those interfaces.

00:18:01.145 --> 00:18:02.237
The controls are routed

00:18:02.279 --> 00:18:03.837
through the surgical
console in Sick Bay,

00:18:03.881 --> 00:18:06.008
but it will take time
to disable all of them.

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.711
We don't have time.

00:18:07.751 --> 00:18:10.982
L'll access the Jefferies tube
that runs under that deck plate,

00:18:11.021 --> 00:18:13.114
set a few charges
and blow out the console.

00:18:13.157 --> 00:18:16.058
Charges? The Hirogen
have seized the armories.

00:18:16.093 --> 00:18:17.219
No problem.

00:18:17.261 --> 00:18:19.786
L got all the ammo l need
right here.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.297
Holographic explosives?

00:18:21.332 --> 00:18:22.799
With the safety protocols
off-line,

00:18:22.833 --> 00:18:26.325
they're as good
as the real thing.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.235
Hmm.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.808
Ah! Another of your warriors?

00:18:33.844 --> 00:18:35.141
Yes.

00:18:35.179 --> 00:18:39.013
He's a frail-looking thing.

00:18:39.049 --> 00:18:40.607
L'll contact you
when l've disabled

00:18:40.651 --> 00:18:42.209
the rest of the interfaces.

00:18:42.252 --> 00:18:43.310
In the meantime, stay here.

00:18:43.354 --> 00:18:44.582
With the Klingons?

00:18:44.621 --> 00:18:48.079
Believe me, it's peaceful
compared to Sainte Claire.

00:18:48.125 --> 00:18:49.251
Captain.

00:18:59.303 --> 00:19:00.895
Please, don't do that.

00:19:13.884 --> 00:19:15.078
They've got us outnumbered!

00:19:15.119 --> 00:19:16.518
And outgunned.

00:19:16.553 --> 00:19:18.077
They're setting up
a machine gun emplacement

00:19:18.122 --> 00:19:19.282
across the street.

00:19:34.171 --> 00:19:35.729
Where have you been?

00:19:35.773 --> 00:19:38.264
Obtaining supplies.

00:19:38.308 --> 00:19:40.435
What is this?

00:19:40.477 --> 00:19:44.140
German technology taken
from their compound.

00:19:44.181 --> 00:19:47.309
L can use them
to enhance our weapons.

00:19:57.628 --> 00:19:59.289
L've cornered
several Voyager crewmen,

00:19:59.329 --> 00:20:01.354
but they've taken refuge
in a guarded building.

00:20:01.398 --> 00:20:04.458
L need three nucleonic charges
to penetrate the structure.

00:20:04.501 --> 00:20:07.595
Nucleonic charges could damage
the holodeck further.

00:20:07.638 --> 00:20:10.232
Use your hand weapons.

00:20:10.274 --> 00:20:11.764
Then l'll need more hunters.

00:20:11.809 --> 00:20:14.277
They're on the way.

00:20:19.683 --> 00:20:21.480
Damn.
There's a level-9 force field

00:20:21.585 --> 00:20:23.075
around the surgical console.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.917
We'll have to go in
and shut it down.

00:20:24.955 --> 00:20:26.047
"Force field"?

00:20:26.089 --> 00:20:27.181
L'll explain later.

00:20:27.224 --> 00:20:29.089
Set the detonator
for five minutes.

00:20:34.164 --> 00:20:36.792
Five hunters have been killed
in the last hour.

00:20:36.834 --> 00:20:39.462
You must engage
the safety protocols.

00:20:39.503 --> 00:20:41.767
Those protocols
aren't functioning.

00:20:41.805 --> 00:20:43.136
Then l'll need assistance to...

00:20:44.541 --> 00:20:45.599
Stand by.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:51.642
You.

00:20:51.682 --> 00:20:53.240
Get him out of here.

00:20:53.283 --> 00:20:55.945
There are ten pounds of dynamite
under the floor

00:20:55.986 --> 00:20:58.216
set to blow in less
than three minutes.

00:20:58.255 --> 00:20:59.381
Move.

00:21:19.877 --> 00:21:22.641
Bridge to Sick Bay.

00:21:24.515 --> 00:21:26.506
Sick Bay, respond.

00:21:28.218 --> 00:21:29.913
Bridge to Deck 5.

00:21:29.953 --> 00:21:32.183
Converge on the Sick Bay.

00:22:10.661 --> 00:22:13.027
- Ow!
- Oh!

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:21.938
We're on the holodeck
under attack.

00:22:21.972 --> 00:22:24.031
You must...

00:22:40.622 --> 00:22:43.182
Bridge, this is Holodeck 1.

00:22:43.225 --> 00:22:44.920
L have seized the building

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:48.293
and l have found
another access to this holodeck.

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:49.661
Seal it.

00:22:49.698 --> 00:22:50.824
How many captives?

00:22:50.866 --> 00:22:51.833
Four.

00:22:51.867 --> 00:22:54.358
Their neural interfaces
have been disabled.

00:22:54.403 --> 00:22:56.667
L will make the kill.

00:22:56.705 --> 00:22:59.003
No. They are not prey;
they are hostages.

00:22:59.041 --> 00:23:00.099
L'll need them.

00:23:00.142 --> 00:23:01.803
As you wish.

00:23:01.844 --> 00:23:04.278
You. Help me seal this hatch.

00:23:09.284 --> 00:23:11.377
So, what do you think?

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:14.048
A boy or a girl?

00:23:14.089 --> 00:23:16.182
Lt's a holographic projection.

00:23:16.225 --> 00:23:18.625
Unfortunately,
it's a very good projection.

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:20.059
L feel 20 kilos heavier.

00:23:20.095 --> 00:23:21.722
It even kicks.

00:23:21.763 --> 00:23:23.458
L don't recognize this program.

00:23:23.498 --> 00:23:25.295
L do.

00:23:25.334 --> 00:23:27.825
He's wearing a Nazi uniform.

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:29.929
We're on Earth
during the second world war.

00:23:29.972 --> 00:23:32.133
"Nazi"?

00:23:32.174 --> 00:23:34.233
Totalitarian fanatics
bent on world conquest...

00:23:34.276 --> 00:23:37.006
the Borg of their day,
no offense.

00:23:37.045 --> 00:23:38.171
None taken.

00:23:50.592 --> 00:23:52.184
What are you staring at?

00:23:52.227 --> 00:23:53.717
Get up.

00:24:00.002 --> 00:24:01.299
You deceived me.

00:24:01.336 --> 00:24:02.303
Really?

00:24:02.337 --> 00:24:04.134
L should've seen through
your flirtations.

00:24:04.172 --> 00:24:05.400
If you say so.

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:09.069
The thought of you
carrying my child disgusts me.

00:24:09.111 --> 00:24:10.976
You're not the only one.

00:24:13.015 --> 00:24:15.074
Look, l don't know what went on

00:24:15.117 --> 00:24:17.483
between the two of you,
but it's obviously over now.

00:24:18.921 --> 00:24:21.719
L see you're acquainted.

00:24:21.757 --> 00:24:24.089
Do you find her as attractive
as l once did?

00:24:27.029 --> 00:24:28.553
L'll miss our nights together.

00:24:29.464 --> 00:24:30.396
Pig!

00:24:32.734 --> 00:24:34.326
Put the weapon away.

00:24:35.904 --> 00:24:38.065
Now.

00:24:48.884 --> 00:24:51.011
Funny. He doesn't
seem like your type.

00:24:55.891 --> 00:24:56.949
Doctor, trouble.

00:24:56.992 --> 00:24:58.084
Now what?

00:24:58.126 --> 00:24:59.855
The Klingons are starting
to wake up from their nap.

00:24:59.895 --> 00:25:01.362
All right, all right, hold on.

00:25:01.396 --> 00:25:03.057
What are you doing?

00:25:03.098 --> 00:25:04.998
L've established an interface
with Holodeck 1.

00:25:05.033 --> 00:25:06.557
L want to monitor
what's going on over there

00:25:06.601 --> 00:25:08.034
in case the crew needs my help.

00:25:08.070 --> 00:25:09.367
Qapla'!

00:25:09.404 --> 00:25:12.373
Uh-oh. What should we do?

00:25:12.407 --> 00:25:13.999
Not having a cure
for Klingon hangovers,

00:25:14.042 --> 00:25:15.134
l couldn't tell you.

00:25:18.947 --> 00:25:20.539
The battle has begun.

00:25:20.582 --> 00:25:23.176
Our plan is to penetrate
the enemy's position,

00:25:23.218 --> 00:25:25.118
cut his forces in half.

00:25:25.153 --> 00:25:26.984
And a very good plan it is.

00:25:27.022 --> 00:25:28.614
Best of luck with it.

00:25:28.657 --> 00:25:30.625
You

00:25:30.659 --> 00:25:33.822
will lead us into
battle, great warrior.

00:25:33.862 --> 00:25:36.262
Maybe l'll just watch
from here...

00:25:36.298 --> 00:25:37.788
try to offer up some pointers

00:25:37.833 --> 00:25:38.857
as things develop.

00:25:38.900 --> 00:25:43.860
To'qaH! Lead the attack
or die here by my hand.

00:25:43.905 --> 00:25:45.372
You heard him.

00:25:45.407 --> 00:25:47.204
Don't argue with the man...
run along.

00:25:47.242 --> 00:25:48.766
L'll reattach any severed limbs.

00:25:48.810 --> 00:25:50.072
Just don't misplace them.

00:25:50.946 --> 00:25:53.141
You! Cover our flank.

00:25:56.385 --> 00:25:57.477
Qapla'!

00:25:57.552 --> 00:25:58.917
Qapla'.

00:25:59.921 --> 00:26:01.047
Tallyho.

00:26:05.861 --> 00:26:06.850
Enter.

00:26:11.967 --> 00:26:13.332
Leave her.

00:26:13.368 --> 00:26:15.928
L see you've done
some redecorating.

00:26:15.971 --> 00:26:19.668
Your attempt
to retake this vessel was...

00:26:19.708 --> 00:26:21.175
inventive.

00:26:21.209 --> 00:26:23.609
From the day l seized
Voyager, you put up

00:26:23.645 --> 00:26:27.342
a dauntless fight,
but your fight is over now.

00:26:27.382 --> 00:26:30.146
You're going to help me
shut down these simulations

00:26:30.185 --> 00:26:31.846
and repair the holodecks.

00:26:31.887 --> 00:26:33.752
No.

00:26:33.789 --> 00:26:36.656
We'll destroy this ship
before we surrender it.

00:26:36.691 --> 00:26:38.750
Don't threaten me, Captain.

00:26:38.794 --> 00:26:41.592
L've faced far more
intimidating prey than you.

00:26:41.630 --> 00:26:44.963
If this fight continues,
l promise you,

00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:49.460
l will hunt down and kill
every member of your crew.

00:26:49.571 --> 00:26:52.165
Well, by then this ship
will be damaged beyond repair

00:26:52.207 --> 00:26:54.835
and there won't be much
of a trophy left, will there?

00:26:54.876 --> 00:26:56.571
Perhaps l should kill you

00:26:56.611 --> 00:26:59.045
and find someone
who will cooperate.

00:26:59.081 --> 00:27:01.379
Good luck.
You'll get the same response

00:27:01.416 --> 00:27:02.383
from all of them.

00:27:02.417 --> 00:27:03.577
You don't realize
what's at stake.

00:27:03.618 --> 00:27:05.882
L know what's at stake...
your sick little game.

00:27:05.921 --> 00:27:08.219
This is not a game!

00:27:08.256 --> 00:27:09.416
Then what is it?

00:27:13.195 --> 00:27:16.187
L'm trying to create a future
for my people.

00:27:16.231 --> 00:27:17.664
Future?

00:27:17.699 --> 00:27:20.327
L don't expect you
to understand.

00:27:20.368 --> 00:27:21.665
You are prey.

00:27:21.703 --> 00:27:23.432
You underestimate us.

00:27:27.476 --> 00:27:28.773
Yes.

00:27:30.712 --> 00:27:32.680
Perhaps l do.

00:27:33.715 --> 00:27:34.909
L'm listening.

00:27:39.387 --> 00:27:43.016
My people are hunting
themselves into extinction.

00:27:44.826 --> 00:27:47.693
Your holodeck technology
might offer us

00:27:47.729 --> 00:27:50.220
an alternative...
a new way of life.

00:27:50.265 --> 00:27:53.063
Instead of scattering ourselves
across the Quadrant

00:27:53.101 --> 00:27:57.367
in pursuit of prey,
we could simulate the hunt

00:27:57.405 --> 00:28:01.967
and give ourselves a chance
to rebuild our civilization.

00:28:02.010 --> 00:28:05.912
And confine your killing
to holograms.

00:28:05.947 --> 00:28:09.405
With the safety protocols
off-line, the pursuit is just

00:28:09.518 --> 00:28:11.042
as challenging.

00:28:11.086 --> 00:28:12.747
Oh, l understand
what you're trying to do,

00:28:12.787 --> 00:28:17.224
but then... why have
you been torturing us?

00:28:17.259 --> 00:28:18.886
Why have you thrown my crew

00:28:18.927 --> 00:28:21.395
into one brutal
simulation after another?

00:28:21.429 --> 00:28:25.422
L've been studying your behavior
as l do with all my prey,

00:28:25.467 --> 00:28:28.595
but your holodecks
allowed me to go further...

00:28:28.637 --> 00:28:32.664
to explore your culture,
your history.

00:28:34.109 --> 00:28:37.442
L must admit
l've learned a great deal.

00:28:37.512 --> 00:28:38.604
How so?

00:28:38.647 --> 00:28:41.775
Your people have faced
extinction many times,

00:28:41.816 --> 00:28:44.444
but you've always
managed to avoid it.

00:28:44.519 --> 00:28:48.649
You seem to recognize
the need for change.

00:28:48.690 --> 00:28:51.056
Yes. You've got one
of those moments

00:28:51.092 --> 00:28:52.650
running right now
on the holodeck.

00:28:52.694 --> 00:28:54.594
We called it World War II.

00:28:54.629 --> 00:28:56.654
One of your most difficult eras.

00:28:56.698 --> 00:28:59.064
And yet you survived.

00:28:59.100 --> 00:29:00.328
It wasn't easy.

00:29:00.368 --> 00:29:03.428
You are a resilient species.

00:29:05.607 --> 00:29:07.973
L admire your cunning.

00:29:09.010 --> 00:29:10.637
Let's end this.

00:29:11.880 --> 00:29:13.609
L'll call a cease-fire

00:29:13.648 --> 00:29:16.412
and we can try
to contain the damage.

00:29:16.484 --> 00:29:19.681
L want my ship back,
but in return, l will give you

00:29:19.721 --> 00:29:22.781
what you need to create
the holodeck technology.

00:29:24.392 --> 00:29:27.520
It would be cunning
for you to agree.

00:29:44.512 --> 00:29:46.980
Synthetic.

00:29:47.015 --> 00:29:49.006
And undrinkable.

00:29:49.050 --> 00:29:51.280
L am tired of this simulation.

00:29:51.319 --> 00:29:53.116
Mein Herr, a word with you.

00:29:53.154 --> 00:29:56.021
And these holograms
are becoming annoying as well.

00:29:56.057 --> 00:29:58.287
What are we waiting for?

00:29:58.326 --> 00:30:01.227
Why don't we execute
these prisoners?

00:30:01.263 --> 00:30:04.699
Orders from the commandant.

00:30:06.601 --> 00:30:07.932
If l may speak freely?

00:30:10.705 --> 00:30:14.072
The commandant has been acting
strangely the past few days.

00:30:14.109 --> 00:30:18.239
He's been questioning
German superiority.

00:30:18.280 --> 00:30:22.683
Perhaps we shouldn't follow
his orders so...

00:30:22.717 --> 00:30:24.344
blindly.

00:30:24.386 --> 00:30:27.150
You will do as he says...

00:30:27.188 --> 00:30:29.918
as long as l tell you to.

00:30:29.958 --> 00:30:31.482
L don't know how much longer

00:30:31.593 --> 00:30:33.493
l can stand
being trapped in here.

00:30:33.561 --> 00:30:36.189
Perhaps you would enjoy
some entertainment.

00:30:43.071 --> 00:30:44.060
Sing.

00:30:45.273 --> 00:30:46.501
L will not.

00:30:46.574 --> 00:30:48.269
Sing...

00:30:49.744 --> 00:30:51.609
or you will die.

00:30:55.350 --> 00:30:57.511
Then l'll die.

00:30:57.585 --> 00:31:01.681
Seven, you are a valued member
of this crew.

00:31:01.723 --> 00:31:04.317
The logical response
would be to grant his request.

00:31:04.359 --> 00:31:05.986
Logic is irrelevant.

00:31:07.329 --> 00:31:10.628
One day the Borg
will assimilate your species

00:31:10.665 --> 00:31:13.327
despite your arrogance.

00:31:13.368 --> 00:31:17.099
When that moment arrives,
remember me.

00:31:17.138 --> 00:31:19.902
Bridge to Holodeck 1.

00:31:19.941 --> 00:31:21.067
Yes.

00:31:21.109 --> 00:31:24.237
L've come to an agreement
with Captain Janeway.

00:31:24.279 --> 00:31:26.247
Call a cease-fire.

00:31:26.281 --> 00:31:27.771
What?!

00:31:27.816 --> 00:31:28.783
Captain?

00:31:28.817 --> 00:31:29.784
Lt's true, Tuvok.

00:31:29.818 --> 00:31:31.115
Our first order of business

00:31:31.152 --> 00:31:32.449
is to call off the troops.

00:31:32.487 --> 00:31:33.818
L want you to find Chakotay

00:31:33.855 --> 00:31:35.686
and have him
convince his soldiers

00:31:35.724 --> 00:31:37.089
to pull out of the city.

00:31:37.125 --> 00:31:38.786
Aye, Captain.

00:31:38.827 --> 00:31:43.127
Turanj, order our hunters
to end the fighting.

00:31:43.164 --> 00:31:44.131
This is madness.

00:31:44.165 --> 00:31:46.133
We're winning this battle.

00:31:46.167 --> 00:31:49.762
Our civilization depends
on this agreement.

00:31:49.804 --> 00:31:51.829
Acknowledged.

00:31:51.873 --> 00:31:53.500
You heard him.

00:31:53.608 --> 00:31:55.007
Release the captives.

00:31:55.043 --> 00:31:56.635
L'll tell the others.

00:31:59.280 --> 00:32:04.445
Order all units
to withdraw to these positions.

00:32:04.486 --> 00:32:06.454
L have always thought
highly of you.

00:32:06.521 --> 00:32:07.715
Have you?

00:32:07.756 --> 00:32:08.745
Yes.

00:32:10.325 --> 00:32:13.123
But the commandant is a fool.

00:32:13.161 --> 00:32:15.629
He doesn't understand.

00:32:15.663 --> 00:32:19.827
He's never embraced
the Fuhrer... or his vision.

00:32:19.868 --> 00:32:23.998
One does not cooperate
with decadent forms of life.

00:32:24.038 --> 00:32:27.132
One hunts them down
and eliminates them.

00:32:27.175 --> 00:32:30.110
The commandant speaks
of civilization.

00:32:30.145 --> 00:32:32.306
The ancient Romans
were civilized.

00:32:32.347 --> 00:32:34.144
The Jews are civilized.

00:32:34.182 --> 00:32:38.016
But in all its moral
decay, Rome fell

00:32:38.052 --> 00:32:40.612
to the spears
of our ancestors...

00:32:40.655 --> 00:32:43.385
as the Jews are falling now.

00:32:45.627 --> 00:32:48.926
Look at our destiny.

00:32:48.963 --> 00:32:50.828
The field of red.

00:32:52.867 --> 00:32:54.960
The purity of German blood.

00:32:55.003 --> 00:32:57.597
The blazing white
circle of the sun

00:32:57.639 --> 00:33:00.005
that sanctified that blood.

00:33:00.041 --> 00:33:04.034
No one can deny us,
no power on Earth or beyond...

00:33:04.078 --> 00:33:07.275
not the Christian savior,
not the God of the Jews.

00:33:07.315 --> 00:33:10.443
We are driven by the very force

00:33:10.485 --> 00:33:13.079
that gives life
to the universe itself.

00:33:13.121 --> 00:33:15.612
We must countermand
the commandant's orders.

00:33:15.657 --> 00:33:17.591
Stay and fight.

00:33:17.625 --> 00:33:19.820
We must be faithful
to who we are.

00:33:26.935 --> 00:33:28.869
You two, follow me.

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:48.013
All units, clear the valley.

00:33:48.055 --> 00:33:49.955
Return
to your previous positions.

00:33:49.991 --> 00:33:51.583
We're calling a cease-fire.

00:33:51.626 --> 00:33:53.856
Repeat. Cease-fire.

00:33:53.894 --> 00:33:55.987
Well, the word is out.

00:33:56.030 --> 00:33:58.089
Whether it will be acted upon
is another question.

00:33:58.132 --> 00:33:59.724
Oh, they'll follow orders.

00:33:59.767 --> 00:34:01.598
L'm their commanding officer,
remember?

00:34:09.076 --> 00:34:11.169
Keep it moving!
Keep it moving!

00:34:11.212 --> 00:34:12.577
Get the lead out of your pants!

00:34:12.613 --> 00:34:14.274
Yes, sir. You heard him!
Let's move it.

00:34:15.316 --> 00:34:17.113
Mid-20th century American slang.

00:34:17.151 --> 00:34:19.085
You got a problem
with that, sister?

00:34:19.120 --> 00:34:22.283
You're enjoying this simulation.

00:34:22.323 --> 00:34:24.450
L find that peculiar,
given the circumstances.

00:34:24.492 --> 00:34:25.584
Loosen up, baby doll.

00:34:25.626 --> 00:34:26.786
The war's almost over.

00:34:31.666 --> 00:34:34.260
So much for the cease-fire!

00:34:34.302 --> 00:34:36.463
Fire! Fire!

00:34:36.504 --> 00:34:38.472
L've been monitoring
the other simulation

00:34:38.506 --> 00:34:39.803
and the fighting's
getting worse.

00:34:39.840 --> 00:34:41.637
The crew is taking
heavy casualties.

00:34:41.676 --> 00:34:43.234
How can we help?

00:34:43.277 --> 00:34:45.609
L'll transfer my program
to Holodeck 1.

00:34:45.646 --> 00:34:47.307
You take the Jefferies tube
and meet me there.

00:34:47.348 --> 00:34:49.373
There's only the two of us.

00:34:49.417 --> 00:34:50.816
Nevertheless,
we have to try and...

00:34:54.522 --> 00:34:55.887
Even half drunk,

00:34:55.923 --> 00:34:59.950
Klingons are among the best
warriors in the galaxy.

00:34:59.994 --> 00:35:02.155
But they're already
in the middle of a war

00:35:02.196 --> 00:35:05.427
with the House of...
mmm, uh, whatever it is.

00:35:05.533 --> 00:35:06.830
Then you'll just have
to convince them

00:35:06.867 --> 00:35:08.562
that there's a more important
battle to be waged.

00:35:08.602 --> 00:35:10.194
What, me?

00:35:10.237 --> 00:35:12.467
You are their "great warrior."
Lead them.

00:35:18.813 --> 00:35:19.973
Pardon me, gentlemen.

00:35:20.014 --> 00:35:22.380
L wonder if l might
have a word with you.

00:35:24.218 --> 00:35:26.345
They're Klingons, not kittens.

00:35:31.525 --> 00:35:33.049
You will listen!

00:35:35.863 --> 00:35:38.764
These sensors show you've placed

00:35:38.799 --> 00:35:40.858
holo-emitters
on Decks 5 through 12?

00:35:40.901 --> 00:35:42.698
No wonder the system breached.

00:35:42.737 --> 00:35:44.466
You've turned Voyager
into one big holodeck.

00:35:44.572 --> 00:35:46.199
Can you shut it down?

00:35:46.240 --> 00:35:48.401
Yes, but l'm going to have
to initiate an overload.

00:35:48.442 --> 00:35:49.807
We'll worry about
making repairs later.

00:35:49.844 --> 00:35:51.869
Right now, we've got to put
an end to those simulations.

00:35:51.912 --> 00:35:53.675
Janeway to Ensign Kim.

00:35:53.714 --> 00:35:54.681
Yes, Captain.

00:35:54.715 --> 00:35:56.012
Harry, l'm going
to need your help

00:35:56.050 --> 00:35:57.745
overloading
the holo-emitter network.

00:35:57.785 --> 00:36:00.982
L'm transferring optical
processor control to you now.

00:36:01.021 --> 00:36:03.216
Start charging the
secondary power relays.

00:36:03.257 --> 00:36:04.986
We'll use them
to trigger the overload.

00:36:05.025 --> 00:36:06.253
L'm on it.

00:36:06.293 --> 00:36:07.385
This is going to take some time.

00:36:07.428 --> 00:36:09.623
There are over 800 emitters
that we have to...

00:36:09.663 --> 00:36:11.426
Move away from the controls!

00:36:11.532 --> 00:36:13.693
Why haven't you ordered
the cease-fire?

00:36:20.641 --> 00:36:22.575
Move away from the controls.

00:36:22.610 --> 00:36:24.441
Listen to me.

00:36:24.478 --> 00:36:25.672
No!

00:36:40.127 --> 00:36:41.719
What are you waiting for?

00:36:41.762 --> 00:36:43.457
L am a hunter.

00:36:43.564 --> 00:36:45.429
You are my prey.

00:36:49.470 --> 00:36:50.869
Run.

00:37:27.674 --> 00:37:30.040
Acknowledged. Out.

00:37:30.076 --> 00:37:32.977
Our holographic allies
are losing ground.

00:37:33.012 --> 00:37:34.673
The German troops
are surrounding the city.

00:37:34.714 --> 00:37:36.705
L don't know how much longer
we can hold them off.

00:37:36.749 --> 00:37:38.717
These weapons are pretty crude.

00:37:38.751 --> 00:37:40.184
They're not much help.

00:37:40.220 --> 00:37:41.551
Maybe we should fall back.

00:37:41.588 --> 00:37:43.886
Where to? They're coming in
from all sides.

00:37:43.923 --> 00:37:45.151
Tuvok, any chance we can get

00:37:45.191 --> 00:37:46.749
through that breach
in the hologrid?

00:37:46.793 --> 00:37:48.590
Unlikely.
20 more Hirogen

00:37:48.628 --> 00:37:50.289
have taken up position
near the opening.

00:37:50.330 --> 00:37:51.592
We are outnumbered.

00:37:53.700 --> 00:37:55.031
How's it going?

00:37:55.068 --> 00:37:56.467
L'm modifying
this explosive device

00:37:56.536 --> 00:37:58.128
to emit a photonic burst.

00:37:58.171 --> 00:37:59.968
It'll be harmless
to organic tissue,

00:38:00.006 --> 00:38:01.803
but it should disrupt
all holographic activity

00:38:01.841 --> 00:38:02.967
within 20 meters.

00:38:03.009 --> 00:38:04.874
We'll try to buy you some time.

00:38:48.488 --> 00:38:49.819
L'll be in Sick Bay.

00:39:10.944 --> 00:39:12.343
Schnell!
Schnell!

00:39:12.378 --> 00:39:14.039
Ja.

00:39:19.719 --> 00:39:21.152
They're closing in.
Seven!

00:39:39.238 --> 00:39:41.035
Surrender.

00:40:18.911 --> 00:40:21.106
Auf stehen.

00:40:23.916 --> 00:40:25.144
Verdammt.

00:40:25.184 --> 00:40:27.015
Bring that one to me.

00:40:30.289 --> 00:40:32.621
L will spare
your life for now,

00:40:32.659 --> 00:40:36.220
but only because you are
carrying a German child.

00:41:08.728 --> 00:41:10.753
Please don't do this.

00:41:15.034 --> 00:41:16.968
L can be of use to you.

00:41:17.003 --> 00:41:19.597
L can help you repair the ship.

00:41:19.639 --> 00:41:21.197
Don't kill me.

00:41:31.184 --> 00:41:32.674
Against the wall.

00:41:37.223 --> 00:41:40.351
Your deaths will serve
the glory of the Reich.

00:41:40.393 --> 00:41:42.725
Prepare to fire.

00:42:17.063 --> 00:42:18.860
Fight on, warriors!

00:42:18.898 --> 00:42:19.865
This way!

00:42:19.899 --> 00:42:21.366
Qapla', gentlemen!
Qapla'!

00:42:38.317 --> 00:42:40.683
This hunt is over.

00:42:40.720 --> 00:42:43.245
Tell your hunters to stand down.

00:42:43.289 --> 00:42:47.851
L'll use this
if you force me to.

00:43:15.822 --> 00:43:17.346
It's over.

00:43:17.390 --> 00:43:19.221
Let's go.

00:43:24.263 --> 00:43:28.996
Captain's Log, Stardate 51715.2.

00:43:29.035 --> 00:43:31.970
The damage to Voyager
has been extreme.

00:43:32.004 --> 00:43:34.700
Both sides have taken
heavy casualties,

00:43:34.740 --> 00:43:38.176
and it's clear that no one
is going to win this conflict.

00:43:38.211 --> 00:43:40.406
The fighting
has reached a standstill

00:43:40.446 --> 00:43:42.380
and the remaining Hirogen

00:43:42.415 --> 00:43:45.009
have agreed
to negotiate a truce.

00:43:45.051 --> 00:43:46.916
What is this?

00:43:46.953 --> 00:43:48.921
An optronic datacore.

00:43:48.955 --> 00:43:52.152
You can use it to create
holodeck technology

00:43:52.191 --> 00:43:54.125
on your own vessels.

00:43:54.160 --> 00:43:57.857
L made a promise with your
leader before he died

00:43:57.897 --> 00:43:59.831
that l would give this
knowledge to the Hirogen.

00:43:59.866 --> 00:44:00.992
Take it.

00:44:01.033 --> 00:44:04.196
His ideas were unconventional.

00:44:04.237 --> 00:44:06.171
L do not share them.

00:44:06.205 --> 00:44:09.368
Was he any more unconventional
than you are...

00:44:09.408 --> 00:44:12.400
calling a cease-fire
with your prey?

00:44:12.445 --> 00:44:14.208
Only a few days ago,

00:44:14.247 --> 00:44:16.181
the thought of speaking
with us on equal terms

00:44:16.215 --> 00:44:19.207
would've been inconceivable,
but here we are.

00:44:19.252 --> 00:44:21.686
Accept this...

00:44:24.523 --> 00:44:26.650
trophy.

00:44:26.692 --> 00:44:30.287
You can use it to create
a new future for your people.

00:44:30.329 --> 00:44:33.196
At the very least, you can
hang it on your bulkhead.
